            "review_title": "Review at Pho De Nhat",
            "review_text": "Glenn C\nSutton, United Kingdom302 contributions\n0\nPerfect Pho\nMar 2020\nWe stopped here with our Guide who recommended this place for lunch. They specialise in the Beef Pho which we duly ordered. The food was very good and very cheap and service friendly. This restaurant appears to be one of several set up by one family and is very traditional. I suppose you would class it as local fast food! Very basic, very good. Try it if you are in the area. Thank you\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 2, 2020",
